date: 2025-12-08 07:30:00 +0200
tags: release
categories: en post
---

I'm happy to announce the release of new Galette 1.2.1 release!

* Rework groups management user interface
* Several fixes and improvements on logo (webp transperency, logo display in mails, ...)
* Change default order on contributions and transactions
* Fix attaching existing contribution on transaction
* Fixes on PDF member cards
* Fix text emails signature
* Fix debug mode using release archives
* Minor fix on CSV exports
* Fix contributions creation from payments plugins
* Fix issues on some PostgreSQL sequences

See [Galette 1.2.1 changelog]({{ site.galette.doc_url }}/{{ site.lang }}/develop/changelog.html#v1210) for all details.

Almost all [plugins]({{ site.galette.doc_url }}/{{ site.lang }}/develop/plugins/) also have been updated, some issues have been fixed and langs updated.

[![Download Galette 1.2.1](https://img.shields.io/badge/1.2.1-Download_Galette-ffb619.svg?logo=php&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge)](https://galette.eu/download/galette-1.2.1.tar.bz2)
{: style="text-align: center;"}

Hope you will enjoy this release; happy Galette!
